1
00:00:12,192 --> 00:00:14,804
Où est le concert ?
Where is the concert?

2
00:00:14,904 --> 00:00:20,132
Il est au parc. Il commence à huit heures.
It's in the park. It starts at eight o'clock.

3
00:00:20,232 --> 00:00:23,300
Comment est-ce qu'on va au parc ?
How do we get to the park?

4
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,900
En métro, c'est rapide.
By metro, it's quick.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,780
Combien coûte le billet ?
How much is the ticket?

6
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:33,020
Le billet coûte dix euros.
The ticket costs ten euros.

7
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:36,356
Pourquoi est-ce que c'est si cher ?
Why is it so expensive?

8
00:00:36,456 --> 00:00:39,908
Parce que c'est un grand concert !
Because it's a big concert!

9
00:00:40,008 --> 00:00:42,380
Qui chante ?
Who is singing?

10
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:47,324
Un chanteur très célèbre. Tu es prêt ?
A very famous singer. Are you ready?
